WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:09.276
When your skin changes, it can be hard to remember what came before: when it started, what you tried, or how it looked a few days ago.

00:00:09.226 --> 00:00:12.731
Skin Casefile keeps that context together.

00:00:12.731 --> 00:00:19.845
Start a case in your own words, add a routine change you remember, and record a photo for analysis.

00:00:19.845 --> 00:00:26.082
With your consent, the photo goes to YouCam through its File API and Skin Analysis API.

00:00:26.082 --> 00:00:32.293
The app waits for the provider's response, then adds four returned readings to your dated case.

00:00:32.293 --> 00:00:37.371
Here, two real check-ins let you review how the readings changed over time.

00:00:37.371 --> 00:00:40.914
The timeline keeps each entry and your note together.

00:00:40.914 --> 00:00:47.152
A score can support your record, but it cannot diagnose you or explain what caused a change.

00:00:47.152 --> 00:00:54.162
The print summary brings your observations and measurements into a clear document for a conversation with a skincare professional.

00:00:54.162 --> 00:00:56.094
Skin Casefile.

00:00:56.094 --> 00:00:58.634
Keep the context with the change.
